advertisement-petspencer-1 = Hello, anyone here?
advertisement-petspencer-2 = Glad you're here!
advertisement-petspencer-3 = We're not overcharging you, we just know what you're worth! Pay up!
advertisement-petspencer-4 = Your money or your life! This is not legally a threat!
advertisement-petspencer-5 = Nine out of ten corpses did NOT stock up on medicine! The last one was an idiot.
advertisement-petspencer-6 = Packs laden with loot are often low on supplies.
advertisement-petspencer-7 = Get gouged, not burned. Patch yourself up!
advertisement-petspencer-8 = I'm not a doctor, but you could be! Self-medicate the pain away!
