goodbye-petspencer-3 = Come back again, if you can.
goodbye-petspencer-4 = Remember, blood leaves stains.
goodbye-petspencer-5 = Don't say I didn't warn you, bub.
goodbye-petspencer-6 = Huh? Oh, you're still here?
goodbye-petspencer-7 = Get lost, I've got potential customers here.
